{"features":[{"feature_idx":0,"name":"en","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":1,"name":"wo","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":2,"name":"non_standardized","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}}],"rows":[{"row_idx":1100,"row":{"en":"They can also disrupt transportation and communication, and lead to food and water shortages.","wo":"Mën nañu itam gàllankoor dem bi ak dikk bi ak jokkoo bi, mën na jur ñàkkug dundu wala ndox.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeun nagnou itam gaalankoor dem bi ak dik bi ak diokoo bi, meun na diour niakou doundou wala ndokh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1101,"row":{"en":"One day, a young boy visited a museum with his parents.","wo":"Benn bis, benn xale la woon mu ànd ak ay waajuram dem ci benn muse.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn biss, benn khalé la wone mou ande ak ay wadjouram dem thi benn musée.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1102,"row":{"en":"This one quote made me realize it is my responsibility to try to restore that bridge between us.","wo":"Benn sitaasioŋ bii xamal nama ni sama wareef la ma defaraat sama diggante ak yeen.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn sitiasion bii khamal nama ni sama waref la ma defarat sama digante ak yeen.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1103,"row":{"en":"They can be dressed up in different clothes, given different furniture to play with, and placed in different settings.","wo":"Mën nañu leen solal xeetu yéere bu nekk, ñu jox leen xeeti mëbal yu ñuy fowee, ñu teg leen ci barab bu nekk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeun nagnou léne solal khétou yéré bou neuk, gnou diokh léne khéti meubal you gnouy fowé, gnou teug léne thi barab bou neuk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1104,"row":{"en":"Grandmother: Well, it's true!","wo":"Maam ju jigéen ji: Waa dëgg la kay!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMame djou djiguéne dji: Waa deug la kay!\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1105,"row":{"en":"Place the chicken on a baking sheet and bake for 20-25 minutes, or until cooked through.","wo":"Tegal ginaar gi ci këyit wiñ koy lakkee nga lakk ko 20 ba 25 simili, wala bamu ñor xomm.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTégal guinar gui thi keuyit wign koy laké nga lakk ko 20 ba 25 simili wala bamou gnor khomm.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1106,"row":{"en":"Eventually, the universe will collapse in on itself and disappear.","wo":"Ginaaw ga mu tas boppam, daal di ni mes.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGinaaw ga mou tass boppam, daldi ni méss.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1107,"row":{"en":"They went on walks, played fetch in the park, and cuddled up on the couch together.","wo":"Ñooy ànd doxante, dàqante ak nëbbatuwante ci pàrk bi, bokk tëdd ci kanape bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnoy and dokhanté dakanté ak neubatuwanté si park bi bokk teudd si canapé bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1108,"row":{"en":"The pair disappeared over the Pacific Ocean on July 2, 1937, and their fate remains unknown.","wo":"Ñoom ñaara ànd réer ci géeju Pacific ci weeru 2 sulet, 1937, ba leegi kenn xamul fuñu mujj.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnom gnara and reer thi guedjou pacifik thi wérou 2 juillet 1937 ba légui kene khamoul fougnou moudj.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1109,"row":{"en":"Finally, make plans for the day of your birthday.","wo":"Soo noppee nga defar sa palaŋu bisu aniwerseer.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo nopé nga defar sa palanu bissou annivairsér.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1110,"row":{"en":"You have now had two chances to correct your behavior, and you have failed to do so.","wo":"Jéggal nañu la ñaari yoon ngir nga soppi sa doxalin nga bañ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDjégal nagnou la niari yoon nguir nga sopi sa dokhaline nga bagné.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1111,"row":{"en":"There are plenty of other fish in the sea.","wo":"Jën yi duñu jeex ci géej gi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDjeun yi dougnou diékh si guédj gui.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1112,"row":{"en":"The door to his room opened, and a young woman walked in.","wo":"Buntu saalam ubbeeku, mu am ndaw su jigéen su duggsi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBount salam oubéku, mou ame ndaw sou djiguéne sou dougsi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1113,"row":{"en":"Today, we're going to be making a simple dish called dal makhani, she said.","wo":"Mu wax leen, tay dama leen di toggal togg bu yomb bu tuddu makhani.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou wakh len tay dama len di togal tog bou yomb bou toudou makhani.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1114,"row":{"en":"Today, science is a major part of modern life, and it continues to play an important role in the advancement of knowledge and understanding.","wo":"Tay, amna cër bu mag ci ni àdduna bi di doxee leegi; te mingi wéy di amal jéego yu am solo ci xóotal xam-xam ak gëna joxe leeral.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTay amna thieur bou mague thi ni addouna bi di dokhé légui té mingui wéy di amal djégo you ame solo thi khotal kham khame ak gueuna diokhé léral.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1115,"row":{"en":"George dreams of one day owning a farm, where he and Lennie can live in peace and harmony.","wo":"George di dundu yaakaar ni bis dina am toolu boppam, fu Lennie mëna dëkk ci jàmm.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGeorge di doundou yakar ni biss dina ame toolou boppam, fou Lennie meuna deuk ci diam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1116,"row":{"en":"We must reject the forces that seek to divide us and come together as one people.","wo":"Danu wara bañ lépp lu nuy jéema xaajale, nu fexe booloo nekk wenn askan.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDanou wara bagn leup lougnouy djéma khadjale, niou fexé booloo nekk wenn askane.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1117,"row":{"en":"As you enter the main entrance, there is a small, cozy lounge area, with two double bedrooms.","wo":"Ci buntu bu mag bi ñuy jaar amna noppalukaay bu féex, amaale ñaari lal double.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThi bountou bou mag bi gnuy diar amna noppaloukay bou fékh, amalé gnari lal double.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1118,"row":{"en":"They have banned all forms of media that they deem to be unpatriotic, and they have arrested and even killed people who speak out against the government.","wo":"Tere nañu bépp xeetu tasukaayu xibaar buñu jàpp ni bëggul réewam, ba noppi ñu jàpp ay nit ray ci ñenn ñi ndax dañu wax ni àndu ñu ak nguur gi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTéré nagnou beup kheutou tassoukayou khibaar bouniou diap ni beugoul réwam, ba noppi niou diap ay nitt ray thi gnénn gni ndakh daniou wakh ni andou gnou ak ngour gui.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1119,"row":{"en":"There are many theories about what happened to Earhart and Noonan.","wo":"Barina lu nit ñi nettali ni moo mujjee dal Earhart ak Noonan.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBarina lou nitt gni netali ni mo moudié dal earhart ak noonan.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1120,"row":{"en":"For example, the warmer temperatures in some areas are making it possible to grow crops that were previously not possible, while the increased precipitation in other areas is making it possible to grow crops that were previously not feasible.","wo":"Ci misaal, tàngoor wu metti wi tax na ñu mëna bay ci yenn gox yi, xeetu mbay mi ñu fa daawul mëna bay bu njëkk, waaye taw yu bari itam tax na ñu mëna bay ci yenn gox yi, xeetu mbay mu ñu fa daawul mëna bay bu njëkk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThi misal tangor wou meti wi takhna gnou meuna bay thi yenn goh yi, khettou mbay mi gnou fa dawoul meuna bay bou ndieuk, wayé taw you bari itam takhna gnou meuna bay thi yenn goh yi, khettou mbay mou gnou fa dawoul meuna bay bou ndieuk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1121,"row":{"en":"I thought about it for a moment.","wo":"Xalaat naa ci ab diir.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhalaat na thi ab diir rek.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1122,"row":{"en":"incredible","wo":"bu kenn mësula gis","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nbou kene meusoula guiss\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1123,"row":{"en":"However, such knowledge is not mine to give.","wo":"Waaye du man maay maye xam-xam boobu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé dou mane may mayé kham kham bobou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1124,"row":{"en":"Amazon has been pressing workers to vote against the union.","wo":"Amazon mingi taxawu liggéeykat ñu baña woteel sindikaa bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmazon moungui takhawou ligueykat gnou bagna wotel sindicat bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1125,"row":{"en":"Animal cruelty is the intentional infliction of pain, suffering, or death upon an animal.","wo":"Def yëfi soxor baayima mooy nga tay ko teg ko metit, sonal ko wala nga ray ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDef yeufi sokhor bayima moye nga tayé ko tegue ko métite, sonal ko wala nga rayé ko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1126,"row":{"en":"That’s how they’ve calculated the combined managed payments percentage!","wo":"Noonu lañu xaymaa pursàntaasu payoor yiñ yor boole leen!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNonou lagnou khayma pourcentassou payoor yign yor boolé léne !\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1127,"row":{"en":"* The acting was really good.","wo":"* Ni ñu ko jouer neex na.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNi gnou ko djouer nekh na.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1128,"row":{"en":"It’s coming from the kitchen, so I get up to investigate.","wo":"Ci waañ wi la doon joge, mani xaaral ma xool lan la.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThi waagn wi la done diogué, mani kharal ma khol lane la.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1129,"row":{"en":"I love my big brother","wo":"Dama bëgg sama mag ju góor","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDama beug sama mag djou goor\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1130,"row":{"en":"Start by taking some time to think about your personal style.","wo":"Toogal nga xalaat ci ni ngay soloo.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nToogal nga khalaat thi ni ngay soloo\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1131,"row":{"en":"When we know what is important to us and we make choices that are consistent with those values, we feel a sense of purpose and direction.","wo":"Sunu xamee linu amal njariñ ba noppi nu def tànneef yu méngoo linu jàpp ni moo baax, danuy yëg ni xam nanu linu bëgg ak finu jëm.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSougnou khamé liniou amal ndiarign ba noppi niou def tanéf you méngo liniou diap ni mo bakh daniouy yeug ni kham nagnou liniou beug ak finiou dieum.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1132,"row":{"en":"Finally, I couldn't take it anymore.","wo":"Ba yàgg, mënatu ma ko muñ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBa yague meunatou mako mouniou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1133,"row":{"en":"Provide positive feedback for strengths that already exist.","wo":"Delloosi ay xibaar ngir ay mënin yu jota am.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDellosi ay khibaar nguir ay meunine you diota ame.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1134,"row":{"en":"This can be applied to people, places, and things.","wo":"Loolu mën nañu ko wax ci nit, barab wala ci ay mbir.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLoolou meun nagnou ko wakh thi nitt barab wala thi ay mbirr.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1135,"row":{"en":"She filled it with all of his favorite ingredients: ground beef, lettuce, tomatoes, cheese, and sour cream.","wo":"Mu def ci saf-safal yi mu gëna bëgg: yàpp buñ fejar, suppome, tomaat, fromaas, ak kreem bu forox.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou def thi saf safal yi mou geuna beugue: yap bougn feudjar, soupome, tomate, frommage ak kreem bou forokh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1136,"row":{"en":"By contrast, the presence of high blood pressure or shortness of breath predicted a worse outcome.","wo":"Waaye, tension bu yéeg boole ci di gaawa sonn narul jur lenn lu baax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé, tension bou yég boolé thi di gawa sonne naroul diour léne lou bakh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1137,"row":{"en":"One of the most important things I learned in high school was how to think critically and solve problems.","wo":"Meneen mbir muma gënoon neex bi may jàngee liise mooy, liñu ma jàngal xalaat bu xóot ak saafara jafe-jafe.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeneune mbir mouma gueunone nekh bi may diangué lycée moy lignou ma diangal khalat bou khot ak safara diafé diafé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1138,"row":{"en":"* 1/4 teaspoon salt","wo":"* 1/4 kuddu kafe xorom","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\n1/4 koudou café khorome\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1139,"row":{"en":"I couldn't believe how high up we were.","wo":"Mënu ma woon gëm ni yéeg nañu fu kawee nii.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeunouma wone geum ni yég nagnou fou kawé nii.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1140,"row":{"en":"I don’t know, Mum says. But it’s big and it’s coming this way.","wo":"Sama yaay niko, xamuma, waaye lu gand la te mingi ñëw fii.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSama yay niko khamouma wayé lou gand la té mingui nieuw fii.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1141,"row":{"en":"The booster shot will make you less contagious and will not inconvenience you","wo":"Soo jële ñakk bi lay yokk doole, doo wàll ñu bari te dina woyof ci yaw","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo dieulé gnak bi lay yok dolé, do wal gnou bari té dina woyof thi yaw\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1142,"row":{"en":"Second, do not expose your cork flooring to direct sunlight for long periods of time, as this can cause the color to fade.","wo":"Ñaareel ba mooy, nga moytu naaj wi di laal sa dëru liege lu yàgg ndax naaj wu bari mën nako furiloo.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNiarél ba moy, nga moytou nadj wi di laal sa deuru liege lou yagg ndakh nadj wou bari meun nako fourilo.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1143,"row":{"en":"But I know that not everyone is as lucky as I was.","wo":"Waaye xamnaa ni du ku nekk a mëna am loolu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé khamna ni dou kou nek meuna ame lolou rék\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1144,"row":{"en":"Krishnan's father, a poor farmer, was desperate to get his son out of jail.","wo":"Pàppay Krishnan daal di jaaxle ndax baykat bu amul dara, xamul nu muy def ba génne doomam jiñu jàpp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nPàppay Krishnan daal di diakhle ndakh baykat bou amoul dara khamoul nou mouy def ba guéné domam djigniou diap.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1145,"row":{"en":"He watched Hamilton writing his name in the discipline file, a file as familiar to him as the bench outside the office.","wo":"Mu xool Hamilton muy bind turam ci dosiye disiplineer bi, muy dosiye bumu miin ni banc bi nekk ci biti soo génnee biro bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou khol Hamilton mouy bind touram thi dossié disciplinaire bi, mouy dossié boumou miine ni banc bi nekk thi biti soo guéné biro bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1146,"row":{"en":"She was a kind-looking woman with a warm smile.","wo":"Jigéen ju baax lay nuru, am ree ju neex.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDjiguéne djou bakh lay nourou ame rew djou nékh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1147,"row":{"en":"Did your high school play an important role in helping you choose your further education and future career?","wo":"Ndax sa daara ju kowe ji amalonnala njeriñ ci dimbalilaa tann sa njang bu gena kawe bi ak sa karier ëllëk?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNdakh sa daara djou kowé dji amalonnala ndierigne si dimbalila tane sa ndiangue bou guena kawé bi ak sa carrière euleuk?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1148,"row":{"en":"We smoked them for several hours, until they were perfectly cooked.","wo":"Nu lakk leen waxtu yu yàgg ba ñu ñor xomm.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNiou lakk léne wakhtou you yague ba gnou nior khomm.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1149,"row":{"en":"Overall, I think this is a solid movie that is worth watching.","wo":"Ci gàttal, jàpp naa ni film bu neex la te jarna seetaan.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThi gatal diapna ni film bou nekh la té diarna sétane.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1150,"row":{"en":"This spark was the first sign of life in the universe.","wo":"Leer googu moom li njëkka màndargaal dundu ci univers bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLér gogou mom li ndieuka mandargal doundou thi univers bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1151,"row":{"en":"He went to see Ramasamy and begged him to release Krishnan, but Ramasamy refused.","wo":"Mu dem gise ak Ramasany daal di koy saraxu ngir mu bàyyi Krishnan, waaye Ramasamy daa bañ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou dem guissé ak ramasany daldi koy sarakhou nguir mou bayi krishnan wayé ramasamy da ban.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1152,"row":{"en":"It's not as if kings and queens have any real power, these days. They're just figureheads.","wo":"Melul ni buur yi ak seeni lingeer yi dañu am doole dëgg, jamono yii dañu leen jiital nii rek.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeuloul ni bour yi ak seeni lingeer yi daniou ame dolé deugue, diamono yii daniou léne djital nii rek.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1153,"row":{"en":"I once had a bike in a small room.","wo":"Mus naa yor velo ci néeg bu ndaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMouss naa yorr vélo ci négg bou ndaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1154,"row":{"en":"Light is a kind of energy that travels in waves.","wo":"Leer benn xeetu energy la buy def ay vague di dem.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLeer beneu kheutou energy la bouy def ay vague di dem.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1155,"row":{"en":"The fight against organ trafficking is a complex one.","wo":"Xeex njaayum cëri nit du lu yomb.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhékh ndiaayoum thieurou nitt dou lou yombe.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1156,"row":{"en":"They have everything you could ever need B: Awesome.","wo":"Am nañu lépp loo musa soxla B: Loolu dinama neex.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmnagnou lép lo meusseu sokhla B: lolou dinama nékhé\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1157,"row":{"en":"It's important to remember that dog attacks are rare, and that most dogs are well-behaved and loving creatures.","wo":"Dafay am solo ñu fàttali ni xaj yi li ñuy songe bariwul, etg ci xaj yu bari dañu rafet jikko ba noppi dañu laabiir.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafay ame solo gnou fattali ni khadj yi li gnouy songé bariwoul, etg thi khadj you bari daniou rafet djikko ba nopi daniou laabiir.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1158,"row":{"en":"I'm sorry, I didn't mean to. I was just trying to get around that slow-moving truck.","wo":"Maa ngi jéggalu, tayu ma ko. Dama doon jéema teggi kamioŋ bee di daw ndànk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMaa ngui djégalou tayouma ko dama done djééma teugui camion bii di daw ndank.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1159,"row":{"en":"Banda was the first president of Malawi and ruled the country from 1964 to 1994.","wo":"Banda mooy ki njëkka nekk njiitu réew ci Malawi ba noppi jiite réew ma diggante 1964 ba 1994.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBanda moy ki ndieuka nekk ndjitou rew thi Malawi ba noppi djité rew ma diguanté 1964 ba 1994.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1160,"row":{"en":"She knew that she was about to come, and she wanted it more than anything she had ever wanted before.","wo":"Mu yëg ni mingi waaja ñëw, muy lumu bëggoon te yamale wuko ak lenn ci àdduna.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou yeug ni moungui wadia nieuw, mouy loumou beugone té yamalé wouko ak len ci aduna.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1161,"row":{"en":"But was she the one for me?","wo":"Waaye, ndax kii laa doon wër?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé ndakh kii la done weur ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1162,"row":{"en":"Deficit reduction requires actually cutting military spending.","wo":"Wàññi li ñuy mànke ci xaalis mingi tàmbalee ci wàññi xaalis biy dugg ci larme bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWanigni li gnouy manké ci khaliss mingui tambalé ci wanigni khaliss bi dougg ci larme bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1163,"row":{"en":"Increasing habitat destruction has seen gray wolf populations shrink in size.","wo":"Yaxxum dëkkuwaay yi taxna ba limu till yu doomu taal yi daadi waññeeku.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYakhoum deukouwayi takhna ba limou till you domou taal yi dadi wagnekou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1164,"row":{"en":"It was for an anti-aging facial mask made with honey, yogurt, and oatmeal.","wo":"Muy rësetu masku kanam buy tere nit ki màgget ñu koy defaree lem, yaawur ak flokon avoine.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMoy resetou masque kanam bouy tere nitt ki maguet nioukoy defaré lem, yaawour ak flocon avoine.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1165,"row":{"en":"Mum and Dad pause their debate when we hear this creepy clacking that sounds like hail falling.","wo":"Sama pàppa ak sama yaay dañu dog seen waxtaan bi nu déggoo bruit bu foor boobu melni tawu glaas.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSama papa ak sama yay daniou dog seen wakhtane bi niou deggoo bruit bou foor bobou melni tawou glaas.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1166,"row":{"en":"Jack Dorsey explained the corporation did not manage the problem nicely.","wo":"Jack Dorsey dafa xamle ni liggéeyukaay bu mag bi doxalee ci jafe-jafe bi rafetul.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nJack Dorsey dafa khamlé ni ligueyoukay bou mag bi doxalé ci diafé diafé bi rafetoul\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1167,"row":{"en":"Can I touch them? the toddler asked.","wo":"Perantal bi laaj, mën naa leen laal?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nParental bi ladj, meun naa len laal ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1168,"row":{"en":"I'm so stressed out about it.","wo":"Loolu dafa ub sama bopp lool.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLoolou dafa oub sama bopp lool rek.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1169,"row":{"en":"He had been in a car accident, and he was unconscious.","wo":"Dafa bokkoon ci aksidaa xamatul woon fumu nekk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafa bokone thi aksidaa khamatoul wone foumou neuk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1170,"row":{"en":"There are many reasons why people choose to adopt a vegetarian diet, including ethical concerns about the treatment of animals, environmental concerns about the impact of animal agriculture on the planet, and health concerns about the consumption of meat.","wo":"Birana lu waral nit ñi tànn nekk vegetarien, ba noppi yor seen lekku bopp mooy, metital gi ñuy teg baayima yi, jafe-jafe yi environmaa bi di am ci yar gi ñuy yar baayima yi ci kaw planet bi, ak jafe-jafe yi lekkum yàpp mëna jur ci wérgi-yaramu nit.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBirana lou waral nitt gni tann nekk vegetarien ba noppi yorr seen lek boupp moy metital gui gnuy teg bayima yi diafé diafé yi environement bi di ame si yar gui gnuy yar bayima yi si kaw planet bi ak diafé diafé yi lekkoum yap meuna diour si wergui yaramou nitt.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1171,"row":{"en":"The gadgets and utensils of the kitchen are a language, a means of communication between cook and food.","wo":"Jumtukaay ak ndab yi ci waañ wi aw làkk lañu, anam wi kiy togg di jokkoo ak ñam wi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDjountoukay ak ndab yi si wañ wi aw lakk lagnou, anam wi kiy tog di djokoo ak ñam wi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1172,"row":{"en":"I'm always here for you.","wo":"Saa yoo ma soxlaa maa ngi fi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSa yoo ma sokhla mangui fi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1173,"row":{"en":"You're more likely to fit in at the gym wearing your yoga outfit than trying to impress the high-fashion crowd.","wo":"Sa yéere yoga yii nga sol demoon ci salle gym la gënoon jekk, moo gën ngay jéema yéem styliste yu mag yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSa yéré yoga yii nga sol démoon ci salle gym la geuneu jekk, mo gueun ngay djéma yéme styliste you mag yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1174,"row":{"en":"After breakfast, people go about their daily activities.","wo":"Su nit ñi ndékkee ba noppi, ku nekk dem ci say yitte.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou nitt gni ndeké ba noppi, kou nek dem si say yitté.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1175,"row":{"en":"In rural areas, people may wake up earlier to tend to their farms or livestock.","wo":"Ñi dëkk ci àll bi dañuy teela yewwu ngir dem tool wala ngir toppatoo seen baayima.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGni deuk ci alle bi daniouy teula yéwou nguir dem tool wala nguir topato sen bayim