hered a large load of leaves.","wo":"Mu naaw wàcci daal di for xob yu bari dajale.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou naw wathi daldi for khob you bari dadialé\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1195,"row":{"en":"The crack propagated through wide portions of the slope and adjacent slopes that weren't steep enough to slide.","wo":"Xar-xar bi dafa yokk bu baax gëna tasaaroo ba yenn wàll ci piste bi ak piste yi ci wetam te wóorul ñu ciy gliise.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhar khar bi dafa yokh bou bakh geuna tassaaro ba yenn wall ci piste bi ak piste yi si wetam té woroul gnou siyeu glissé\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1196,"row":{"en":"The resulting loss of homes and livelihoods can force people to relocate, which can lead to social and economic problems.","wo":"Bu nit ñi ñàkkee seen kër, dëkkuwaay yi yàqu mën na tax ñu toxal leen feneen, te loolu dafay indil askan wi ay jafe-jafe koom.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBou nitt gni gnakké seen keur deukouway yi yakh meun na takh gnou tokhal lén fénéne té lolou dafay indil askane wi ay diafé diafé kom.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1197,"row":{"en":"We had to go outside and play.","wo":"Dañu daan génn di fowi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDagnou dane guenn di fowi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1198,"row":{"en":"Then, use your scissors or clippers to clip the tip of the nail.","wo":"Ba noppi nga jël siso bi wala daggukaayu we bi nga dagg catu we wi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBa noppi nga dieul ciseaux bi wala dagukayou wé bi nga dague sathiou wé wi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1199,"row":{"en":"I have been living with type 1 diabetes for over 20 years.","wo":"Lu ëpp 20 at a ngi nii may dundu ak diabet type 1.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLou eup 20 ans a ngui nii may doundou ak diabète type 1.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]}],"num_rows_total":3438,"num_rows_p